# convex
# Local CLI state only. `packages/convex/.env.local` (CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT) is
# already covered by the env rules above.
#
# NOTE: packages/convex/convex/_generated/ is deliberately NOT ignored — apps/web
# imports it (@home/convex/api), so it is committed and refreshed with
# `bun run codegen` in packages/convex.
.convex/

